      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アージェ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "はい。モンスター娘さん達から様々な話を聞いて、\n色々と参考にすることが出来ました。\nとても勉強になっています。",
        "",
        "ch_10238/R18/10238B0_10238_Nml/10238B0_10238_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "アージェ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10238/R18/10238B0_10238_Nml/10238B0_10238_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e7da899cb96ad33f8d81e4d4f8813d1229345320dabd63766f8f54d1dc45001f",
